{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Act as an expert Shopify theme developer. Generate a responsive, pixel-perfect, custom sections block for a Case Study Spotlight component. The design must precisely mirror the layout, spacing, and styling details provided below while automatically inheriting the current Shopify theme's global typography, primary max-width (e.g., 1200px), and core button styles.
    
    ---
    
    ### 1. SECTION ARCHITECTURE & LAYOUT
    
    Create a parent container that wraps individual "Case Study" blocks. Each block consists of distinct vertical zones stacked with intentional, clean whitespace:
    
    #### ZONE 1: HEADER (Flex Row, Space-Between)
    - Left Side: A dynamic flex row containing a Brand Image and the Title block side-by-side:
      - Brand Image: A placeholder/setting for an uploaded image asset (rendered in a square container, border-radius: 12px, subtle light-grey border). Ensure it scales cleanly without distortion.
      - Title Stack (stacked vertically next to the image):
        - Meta-info: "Fashion • Enterprise Scale" (Small, muted grey text)
        - Case Study Title: "Major Japanese Fashion Retailer" (Bold, prominent, dark navy/slate color)
        - Sub-info: "124 → 220 stores" (Muted text showing scale change)
    - Right Side: A solid pill-shaped badge labeled "FEATURED" using a muted olive/moss green background (`#a4b953` or similar theme variant) with white uppercase text.
    
    #### ZONE 2: INTRODUCTORY PARAGRAPH
    - A full-width, 2-3 sentence summary paragraph. 
    - Styling: Medium-grey text color, comfortable line-height (e.g., 1.6), and generous top/bottom margin to separate it from the header and the results card.
    
    #### ZONE 3: MEASURED RESULTS CARD (Grid Container)
    - A full-width callout box with a very soft, light cream/green tinted background, rounded corners (border-radius: 16px), and internal padding (around 24px-32px).
    - Inside, lay out a 2x2 grid (collapsing to a 1x4 stack on mobile devices):
      - Each grid item contains a small, solid moss-green square icon (`#a4b953`) with a white upward-trending arrow.
      - Text inline or stacked next to the icon: Bold the metric or main phrase, followed by regular weight for details (e.g., "**Conversion improved 8.93%**", "**Sales increased 8.25%** = ¥1.8 billion additional revenue").
    
    #### ZONE 4: TWO-COLUMN DETAILS (Flex/Grid, 50/50 Split)
    - Below the results card, split the layout into two columns on desktop (stacked on mobile):
      - Column 1 (CHALLENGES BEFORE): A bulleted list with a subtle grey disc. Text color is a muted slate grey.
      - Column 2 (OPERATIONAL IMPACT): A list utilizing thin green checkmarks instead of bullet points. Text color is a darker slate grey.
    - Ensure clear headings for both columns in muted, uppercase typography.
    
    #### ZONE 5: FOOTER & BUTTON
    - A full-width dark navy button (`#0a2240` or the theme's primary dark color) aligned to the bottom left. 
    - Features white text, an right-facing arrow icon (→), and explicit padding to match the theme’s standard button styling.
    - A thin, full-width neutral divider line separates this section block from the next block.
    
    ---
    
    ### 2. DESIGN & BRAND ALIGNMENT RULES
    
    - Image Block Logic: The section setting must explicitly allow an image upload (`type": "image_picker"`) for each case study block to replace the brand placeholder.
    - Typography: Do NOT hardcode font families. Inherit the Shopify theme's heading font for titles/metrics and the theme's body font for lists and descriptions.
    - Sizing & Max-Width: Constrain the component within the theme's standard section wrapper max-width (`var(--page-width)`). Ensure it centers automatically on large viewports.
    - Repeatable Logic: Structure this as a repeatable Shopify theme block schema so that multiple case studies can be stacked or added sequentially.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-case-study-spotlight-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: var(--page-width);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 var(--spacing-section-horizontal);
    margin-bottom:2rem;
  }

  .ai-case-study-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 32px;
    padding-bottom: 48px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
  }

  .ai-case-study-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 24px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .ai-case-study-header-left-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: 20px;
    align-items: flex-start;
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .ai-case-study-brand-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 80px;
    height: 80px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    overflow: hidden;
    background-color: #ffffff;
  }

  .ai-case-study-brand-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .ai-case-study-brand-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background-color: #f9fafb;
  }

  .ai-case-study-brand-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    opacity: 0.3;
  }

  .ai-case-study-title-stack-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .ai-case-study-meta-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #6b7280;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .ai-case-study-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #0a2240;
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .ai-case-study-sub-info-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: #6b7280;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .ai-case-study-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    padding: 8px 20px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.badge_color }};
    color: #ffffff;
    border-radius: 50px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .ai-case-study-intro-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #4b5563;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-case-study-results-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.results_bg_color }};
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 32px;
  }

  .ai-case-study-results-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .ai-case-study-result-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .ai-case-study-result-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.icon_color }};
    border-radius: 6px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .ai-case-study-result-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
    stroke: #ffffff;
    fill: none;
    stroke-width: 2.5;
  }

  .ai-case-study-result-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex: 1;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: #1f2937;
  }

  .ai-case-study-result-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} strong {
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #111827;
  }

  .ai-case-study-details-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 40px;
  }

  .ai-case-study-detail-column-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .ai-case-study-detail-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    color: #6b7280;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-case-study-detail-list-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .ai-case-study-detail-list-{{ ai_gen_id }} li {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: flex-start;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: #4b5563;
  }

  .ai-case-study-detail-list-{{ ai_gen_id }} li::before {
    content: '';
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: #9ca3af;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }

  .ai-case-study-detail-list-{{ ai_gen_id }}.ai-case-study-checkmark-list-{{ ai_gen_id }} li::before {
    content: '✓';
    width: auto;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: 0;
    background-color: transparent;
    color: {{ block.settings.icon_color }};
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 18px;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  .ai-case-study-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: flex-start;
  }

  .ai-case-study-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 16px 32px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.button_bg_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.button_text_color }};
  }


  .ai-case-study-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    stroke: currentColor;
    fill: none;
    stroke-width: 2;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-case-study-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .ai-case-study-header-left-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: 100%;
    }

    .ai-case-study-brand-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: 64px;
      height: 64px;
    }

    .ai-case-study-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 22px;
    }

    .ai-case-study-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      align-self: flex-start;
    }

    .ai-case-study-intro-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .ai-case-study-results-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 24px;
    }

    .ai-case-study-results-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .ai-case-study-details-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 32px;
    }

    .ai-case-study-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: 100%;
      justify-content: center;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<div class="ai-case-study-spotlight-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-case-study-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-case-study-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-case-study-header-left-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ai-case-study-brand-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% if block.settings.brand_image %}
            <img
              src="{{ block.settings.brand_image | image_url: width: 160 }}"
              alt="{{ block.settings.brand_image.alt | escape }}"
              loading="lazy"
              width="80"
              height="80"
            >
          {% else %}
            <div class="ai-case-study-brand-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
            </div>
          {% endif %}
        </div>

        <div class="ai-case-study-title-stack-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% if block.settings.meta_info != blank %}
            <div class="ai-case-study-meta-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.meta_info }}</div>
          {% endif %}
          {% if block.settings.title != blank %}
            <h2 class="ai-case-study-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.title }}</h2>
          {% endif %}
          {% if block.settings.sub_info != blank %}
            <div class="ai-case-study-sub-info-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.sub_info }}</div>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      </div>

      {% if block.settings.show_badge %}
        <div class="ai-case-study-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.badge_text }}</div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>

    {% if block.settings.intro_text != blank %}
      <div class="ai-case-study-intro-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.intro_text }}</div>
    {% endif %}

    <div class="ai-case-study-results-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-case-study-results-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.result_1 != blank %}
          <div class="ai-case-study-result-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <div class="ai-case-study-result-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                <polyline points="22 7 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 2 17"></polyline>
                <polyline points="16 7 22 7 22 13"></polyline>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div class="ai-case-study-result-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.result_1 }}</div>
          </div>
        {% endif %}

        {% if block.settings.result_2 != blank %}
          <div class="ai-case-study-result-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <div class="ai-case-study-result-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                <polyline points="22 7 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 2 17"></polyline>
                <polyline points="16 7 22 7 22 13"></polyline>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div class="ai-case-study-result-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.result_2 }}</div>
          </div>
        {% endif %}

        {% if block.settings.result_3 != blank %}
          <div class="ai-case-study-result-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <div class="ai-case-study-result-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                <polyline points="22 7 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 2 17"></polyline>
                <polyline points="16 7 22 7 22 13"></polyline>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div class="ai-case-study-result-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.result_3 }}</div>
          </div>
        {% endif %}

        {% if block.settings.result_4 != blank %}
          <div class="ai-case-study-result-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <div class="ai-case-study-result-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                <polyline points="22 7 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 2 17"></polyline>
                <polyline points="16 7 22 7 22 13"></polyline>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div class="ai-case-study-result-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.result_4 }}</div>
          </div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ai-case-study-details-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-case-study-detail-column-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.challenges_heading != blank %}
          <h3 class="ai-case-study-detail-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.challenges_heading }}</h3>
        {% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.challenges_list != blank %}
          <ul class="ai-case-study-detail-list-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% assign challenges = block.settings.challenges_list | split: '|' %}
            {% for challenge in challenges %}
              <li>{{ challenge | strip }}</li>
            {% endfor %}
          </ul>
        {% endif %}
      </div>

      <div class="ai-case-study-detail-column-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.impact_heading != blank %}
          <h3 class="ai-case-study-detail-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.impact_heading }}</h3>
        {% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.impact_list != blank %}
          <ul class="ai-case-study-detail-list-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-case-study-checkmark-list-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% assign impacts = block.settings.impact_list | split: '|' %}
            {% for impact in impacts %}
              <li>{{ impact | strip }}</li>
            {% endfor %}
          </ul>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>

    {% if block.settings.button_text != blank %}
      <div class="ai-case-study-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <a href="{{ block.settings.button_link }}" class="ai-case-study-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}  btn btn--primary">
          {{ block.settings.button_text }}
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line>
            <polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline>
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Case study spotlight",
  "tag": null,
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Brand and title"
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "brand_image",
      "label": "Brand image"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "meta_info",
      "label": "Meta info",
      "default": "Fashion • Enterprise Scale"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "title",
      "label": "Case study title",
      "default": "Major Japanese Fashion Retailer"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "sub_info",
      "label": "Sub info",
      "default": "124 → 220 stores"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Badge"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_badge",
      "label": "Show badge",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "badge_text",
      "label": "Badge text",
      "default": "FEATURED"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "badge_color",
      "label": "Badge color",
      "default": "#a4b953"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Introduction"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "intro_text",
      "label": "Intro paragraph",
      "default": "<p>This major Japanese fashion retailer transformed their omnichannel operations, achieving significant improvements in conversion rates and revenue while expanding their store network across the country.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Results card"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "results_bg_color",
      "label": "Background color",
      "default": "#f0f4e8"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "icon_color",
      "label": "Icon color",
      "default": "#a4b953"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "result_1",
      "label": "Result 1",
      "default": "<p><strong>Conversion improved 8.93%</strong></p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "result_2",
      "label": "Result 2",
      "default": "<p><strong>Sales increased 8.25%</strong> = ¥1.8 billion additional revenue</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "result_3",
      "label": "Result 3",
      "default": "<p><strong>Store network expanded</strong> from 124 to 220 locations</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "result_4",
      "label": "Result 4",
      "default": "<p><strong>Operational efficiency</strong> improved across all channels</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Challenges before"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "challenges_heading",
      "label": "Heading",
      "default": "CHALLENGES BEFORE"
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "challenges_list",
      "label": "List items",
      "info": "Separate each item with a pipe character (|)",
      "default": "Fragmented inventory across channels|Limited real-time visibility|Manual processes slowing operations|Inconsistent customer experience"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Operational impact"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "impact_heading",
      "label": "Heading",
      "default": "OPERATIONAL IMPACT"
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "impact_list",
      "label": "List items",
      "info": "Separate each item with a pipe character (|)",
      "default": "Unified inventory management system|Real-time stock visibility across all locations|Automated fulfillment workflows|Seamless omnichannel customer journey"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Call to action"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "button_text",
      "label": "Button text",
      "default": "Read full case study"
    },
    {
      "type": "url",
      "id": "button_link",
      "label": "Button link"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "button_bg_color",
      "label": "Button background",
      "default": "#0a2240"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "button_text_color",
      "label": "Button text",
      "default": "#ffffff"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "desktop_width_percent",
      "label": "Desktop width",
      "min": 50,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 5,
      "unit": "%",
      "default": 100
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Case study spotlight"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}